            "answer": {
              "short": "$r = 0.98264$",
              "worked": "Enter years in A2:A9 and heights in B2:B9. Use the spreadsheet formula =CORREL(A2:A9,B2:B9).\n\n$r = 0.982640459\\ldots \\approx 0.98264$",
