            "answer": {
              "short": "$y = 0.1524x - 134.57$",
              "worked": "Create a scatter chart with year as $x$ and height in centimetres as $y$. Add a linear trendline and display its equation.\n\n$y = 0.152380952\\ldots x - 134.571428571\\ldots$\n\nTo the requested precision, $y = 0.1524x - 134.57$.",
